RLCD-FedLoRA source release

This distribution contains code derived from and reorganized from
"Federated-Learning-for-NLP-Tasks", originally licensed under the MIT License
and Copyright (c) 2024 Atul Kumar.

The RLCD-FedLoRA additions implement adaptive layer-budget control, layer
selection, per-layer LoRA factor selection, and selected-factor aggregation.

The experiment integrations also include hybrid baseline adaptations,
validation-based evaluation, and private-data preprocessing utilities.
Pretrained model weights and MIMIC data are not redistributed under this license.
